# Transaction replay API requests
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18002
@eventId = d6a69ef3-8b61-5f3c-b87d-ce5e0db51299

### Process liveness, not model readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Scoring is not ready during preparation (503)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready/scoring

### Access/schema must first be configured; use a local secret, never commit it
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{eventId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv RESULT_API_TOKEN}}

### Resolve an existing pending review; identity comes from server REVIEWER_ID
# Repeat identical resolution_id/body to recover an uncertain response safely.
# Do not include card numbers, personal data or confirmed fraud labels in notes.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{eventId}}/review-resolution
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv REVIEW_API_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resolution_id": "75b81317-23c8-4abd-9032-fd4c8376bbca",
  "resolution": "allow",
  "notes": "Reviewed synthetic transaction evidence"
}

### Unknown UUID is 404 only after authentication and database preparation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/result
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv RESULT_API_TOKEN}}
